sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as OpenServ
  participant W as Worker
  participant S as SERV Reasoning
  participant R as Record
  participant D as Desk contract
  participant T as Telegram

  O->>W: Wake the hourly check
  W->>D: Read balances, limits, prices
  W->>W: Find drift and apply fixed refusals
  alt Nothing to do or refused
    W->>R: Save the outcome
  else A trade may help
    W->>S: When should it act?
    S-->>W: Choice, reasons, confidence
    W->>W: Recheck the owner's limits
    W->>R: Hash decision and plan the send
    W->>D: AgentKit-signed action + hash
    D-->>W: Receipt or revert
    W->>R: Append the actual result
  end
  W->>T: Tell the owner what happened
